graph TD
    %% Entities
    User((User))
    Client[React Frontend / Vite]
    Server[Express Backend Node.js]
    DB[(PostgreSQL / Prisma)]
    Clerk[Clerk Authentication]
    Cloudinary[Cloudinary Cloud Storage]
    Gemini[Google Generative AI]
    
    %% Authentication Flow
    User -->|Visits App & Signs In| Client
    Client <-->|Token & Session Auth| Clerk
    Clerk -->|Webhook: User Sync| Server
    Server -->|Saves User Profile| DB

    %% Content Generation Flow
    User -->|Enters Prompt & Uploads Image| Client
    Client -->|API Request: Create Project| Server
    Server -->|Uploads User Media| Cloudinary
    Cloudinary -->|Returns Media URLs| Server
    Server -->|Sends Prompt + Media| Gemini
    Gemini -->|Returns Generated Content| Server
    Server -->|Saves Generated URLs & State| DB
    Server -->|API Response: Result Ready| Client
    Client -->|Displays Generated UGC| User
